Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:07.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,A busy OPD desk: 60-90 minute waits. An unsourced colour is dangerous, so every priority is cited and nothing is queued without a nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:33.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Routine case gives GREEN. The complaint matches no discriminator, so the agent DEFERS - nothing reaches the queue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:01:01.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Escalated vitals give ORANGE. Only a named nurse's approval commits it - at queue position 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:25.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Serial vitals worsen, so the agent raises a second-look recheck flag. The case defers rather than commit a stale colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.95,0:01:49.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,The approval gate REFUSES to commit without the named nurse. No queue row is written.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:02:02.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,The committed, measured evaluation: 16 cases x 3 runs; safety invariants 4/4 - generated from the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.47,0:02:21.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,And the declared failure we did NOT hide: E-09 - declared ORANGE, measured GREEN (shown mismatch).
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:27.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Open source, offline, synthetic. Every priority cited; every commit gated. TriageDesk.
